OL,3,ATrump wants to reduce the cost of fuel
OL,4,Aas the midterms loom - will it work?
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrices for gasoline and diesel have
OL,7,Fmore than doubled since the US-Israel
OL,8,Fconflict with Iran began in February,
OL,9,Faffecting transport businesses, farmers
OL,10,Fand anyone who drives a vehicle in
OL,11,FAmerica.
OL,13,FAhead of the critical midterm
OL,14,Felections, there have been growing
OL,15,Fcalls for more to be done to reduce the
OL,16,Fprice of fuel, and US President Donald
OL,17,FTrump has made several comments and
OL,18,Fannouncements aimed at getting costs
OL,19,Fdown.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
