OL,3,ATrump wants to reduce the cost of fuel
OL,4,Aas the midterms loom - will it work?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe question is: what is he able to do
OL,7,Fwith just a few weeks to go before
OL,8,Felection day - and will it work?
OL,10,FTrump's announcement of a waiver on the
OL,11,Fuse of red dye diesel at a campaign
OL,12,Fstop this week underscored the
OL,13,Fimportance of gas prices in a midterm
OL,14,Felection dominated by affordability
OL,15,Fissues.
